migrate_working_dir/

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# VS Code related (keep launch.json but ignore other VS Code settings)
.vscode/*

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Environment config files (real secrets/addresses → DO NOT commit)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# 真实的开发/测试/生产环境配置文件，包含密钥和真实地址，不提交 Git
# 使用前请先复制 config/env_template.json 并填入真实值
config/*.json
# 模板文件需要提交到 Git，供团队成员参考
!config/env_template.json

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
